"button.label.mirrorpeeper.Monitoring" : "Mirror Peep"
"role.lurker.name" : "Lurker"
"role.lurker.short" : "Lurk"
"role.lurker.blurb" : "Cutting through obstacles"
"options.role.lurker.ckc" : "Can Kill"
"options.role.lurker.cooldown" : "Kill Cooldown"
"options.role.lurker.nt" : "Lurker does not need to do tasks"
"button.label.lurker.kill" : "Kill"
"options.role.lurker.detail" : "The Lurker can prevent all factions except the Crewmate faction from winning,<br>until they die.<br><b>This is one of Half Sugar's gifts to you!</b>"
"role.lurker.doc" : "The Lurker can prevent all factions except the Crewmate faction from winning until the Lurker dies. <b><color=#00ffff>%CANKILL%</color></b>%NT%"
"role.lurker.ck.true" : "<br>When a non-Crewmate faction can win, <b>the Lurker gains a one-time kill ability</b>, with a kill cooldown of <b><color=#00ffff>%CD% seconds</color></b>"
"role.lurker.ck.false" : ""
"role.lurker.nt.true" : "，<b><color=#00ffff><br>Also, the Lurker has no tasks.</color></b>"
"role.lurker.nt.false" : "."
"role.dilemma.name" : "Chooser"
"role.dilemma.blurb" : "What will you choose?"
"options.role.dilemma.detail" : "You can press a button to make a random event happen.<br><b>This is one of Half Sugar's gifts to you!</b>"
"role.dilemma.doc" : "You can press a button to make a random event happen."
"role.dilemma.ability.title" : "Innate Ability [Choice]"
"role.dilemma.ability.main" : "A manual is attached to the button, listing possible events.<b><br>1. Call an emergency meeting in your name<br>2. Kill an Impostor; if there are no Impostors, nothing happens.<br>3. Explode (only kills the user)<br>4. Become a normal person again<br>5. Give a random person a Green Key (i.e., Keymaster modifier)<br>6. Swap roles with a random person.</b>"
"role.dilemma.ability.doc" : "<b>Choice</b><br>Press the button to trigger a choice event."
"role.dilemma.hudtextSuicide" : "(Explosion sound)"
"options.role.dilemma.maxUses" : "Max Skill Uses"
"options.role.dilemma.cooldown" : "Skill Cooldown"
"options.role.dilemma.AddMaxUsesWhenDoTask" : "Increase Uses After Doing Tasks"
"options.role.dilemma.NeedTasksCount" : "Tasks Needed to Increase Uses"
"button.label.dilimma.choose" : "Choose"
"role.dilemma.hudtextKillImp" : "Seems like an Impostor died..."
"role.dilemma.hudtextNoImp" : "There are no Impostors left"
"role.dilemma.hudtextBeCrew" : "The button disappeared?"
"role.dilemma.hudtextAddModi" : "Someone obtained a key"
"role.dilemma.hudtextChangeRole" : "Who... is this?"
"role.dilemma.hudtextUn" : "Impossible"
"role.karmatic.name" : "Karmatic"
"role.karmatic.blurb" : "Isn't wonderful karma also your protective umbrella"
"role.karmatic.doc" : "The Karmatic can use 「Causality Chain」 to select a person and give them karmic retribution.<br>Karma takes effect in the next round."
"options.role.karmatic.detail" : "The Karmatic can use 「Causality Chain」 to select a person and give them karmic retribution<br><b>This is one of Half Sugar's gifts to you!</b>"
"role.karmatic.ability.title" : "Innate Ability [Karmic Retribution]"
"role.karmatic.doc.causalitychain" : "<b>Causality Chain</b><br>Follow a person for <b><color=#00ffff>%FT% seconds</color></b> to give them a Karma modifier.<br>Max <b><color=#00ffff>%MaxUses% uses</color></b>, cooldown <b><color=#00ffff>%CD% seconds</color></b>."
"role.karmatic.ability.main" : "You can use <b>Causality Chain</b> to select a person, giving them a Karma modifier after this round ends.<br>Then, %NameDeco%.<br>The Karma holder's kill attempts will not take effect, and %TryKillSomebody%.<br>After <b><color=#00ffff>%MeetingTimes% rounds</color></b>, the Karma modifier is removed."
"options.role.karmatic.NameDeco.K.Des" : "<b><color=#00ffff>The Karma holder will have a purple 「K」 suffix in your eyes.</color></b>"
"options.role.karmatic.NameDeco.Color.Des" : "<b><color=#00ffff>The Karma holder's name will appear purple to you</color></b>"
"options.role.karmatic.deadkillkarma.true" : "<b><color=#00ffff>The person the Karma tries to kill will counter-kill the Karma.</color></b>"
"options.role.karmatic.deadkillkarma.false" : "<b><color=#00ffff>The Karma will commit suicide</color></b>"
"options.role.karmatic.CausalityChainCoolDown" : "Causality Chain Cooldown"
"options.role.karmatic.followtime" : "Time Needed to Apply Causality Chain"
"options.role.karmatic.CausalityChainMaxUses" : "Max Causality Chain Uses"
"options.role.karmatic.EraseKarmaMeetingTimes" : "Rounds Needed to Erase Karma"
"options.role.karmatic.deadkillkarma" : "Victim Counter-kills Karma"
"options.role.karmatic.deadkillkarma.detail" : "When enabled, the victim will directly kill the Karma.<br>When disabled, the Karma will commit suicide before attempting to kill."
"options.role.karmatic.NameDeco" : "Karma Name Decoration Type"
"options.role.karmatic.NameDeco.K" : "Append 「K」 after name"
"options.role.karmatic.NameDeco.Color" : "Set name to purple"
"options.role.karmatic.NeedImp" : "Backlash only when Karma holder is Impostor"
"options.role.karmatic.NeedImp.detail" : "When enabled, the backlash will not take effect if the Karma holder is not an Impostor."
"button.label.CausalityChain" : "Causality Chain"
"role.karmatic.tips" : "<b>· When using 「Causality Chain」 to apply Karma to others, the Karma modifier does not appear immediately but is applied after this round ends.</b>"
"role.objector.name" : "Objector"
"role.objector.blurb" : "I'm not satisfied with the result of this meeting"
"role.objector.doc" : "You can use the <b>Objection</b> skill in meetings.<br>When Objection takes effect, all votes cast in this meeting are changed to skip votes during counting, and no one will be exiled this round.<br>You can cancel the objection at any time before the voting results are announced; canceling refunds the use."
"options.role.objector.detail" : "The Objector can use a skill to invalidate the current meeting's votes<br><b>This is one of Half Sugar's gifts to you!</b>"
"role.objector.ability.title" : "<b>Innate Ability [Objection Ruling]</b>"
"role.objector.ability.main" : "You can use Objection to change all votes in this meeting to skip votes.<br>If you change your mind, you can cancel the objection before the voting results appear, and the use is refunded.<br>When the objection takes effect, the whole screen flashes red, and a cost is paid according to settings."
"role.objector.doc.objection" : "<b>Objection</b><br>Raise an objection during the meeting phase. Max <b><color=#00ffff>%USES% uses.</color></b>"
"role.objector.doc.cancel" : "<b>Cancel Objection</b><br>Can cancel the objection."
"role.objector.tips" : "<b>· Not recommended to enable this role with non-anonymous voting</b>"
"options.role.objector.uses" : "Max Objection Uses"
"objector.ui.uses" : "Remaining objections: %LEFTUSES%"
"role.saboteur.name" : "Saboteur"
"role.saboteur.short" : "Sab"
"role.saboteur.blurb" : "Power of chaos"
"role.saboteur.doc" : "Each time a sabotage is successfully fixed, your kill cooldown is permanently reduced.<br>Killing players during a sabotage additionally reduces the kill cooldown for that sabotage.<br>The number of permanent reductions and the reduction amounts are set by the host."
"options.role.saboteur.detail" : "The Saboteur gains kill CD reduction both after and during sabotages.<br><b>This is one of Half Sugar's gifts to you!</b>"
"options.role.saboteur.killcooldown" : "Kill Cooldown"
"options.role.saboteur.reduceSabotage" : "Permanent Reduction per Sabotage"
"options.role.saboteur.reduceKill" : "Reduction per Kill During Sabotage"
"options.role.saboteur.minCooldown" : "Minimum Kill Cooldown"
"options.role.saboteur.maxStack" : "Max Permanent Reductions"
"role.saboteur.ability.doc" : "..Each time a sabotage is successfully fixed, your kill cooldown is permanently reduced.<br>Killing players during a sabotage additionally reduces the kill cooldown for that sabotage.<br>The number of permanent reductions and the reduction amounts are set by the host."
"role.mage.name" : "Mage"
"role.mage.short" : "Mage"
"role.mage.blurb" : "Crushed in fragility, or remembering the purest self"
"role.mage.doc" : "Apply a Fragility curse to the target; those who can't stay idle will be sacrificed to your magic. Or, quietly restore them to how they were in the beginning?"
"options.role.mage.detail" : "The Mage can apply a Fragility curse to targets, causing death when they do tasks or use skills.<br>The second personality's kills leave only ashes.<br><b>This is one of Half Sugar's gifts to you!</b>"
"role.mage.ability.title" : "<b>Innate Ability [Two Sides of Man]</b>"
"role.mage.ability.main" : "In the first personality, use Fragility to cause the target to die after doing tasks or using skills.<br>In the second personality, use Restore for an area kill, leaving only ashes"
"role.mage.doc.weak" : "<b>Fragility</b><br>Apply a Fragility curse to the target; the target dies after doing tasks or using skills<br><b>This skill is only active in the first personality</b>"
"role.mage.doc.restore" : "<b>Restore</b><br>After use, targets within a certain range die, leaving only ashes<br><b>This skill is only active in the second personality</b>"
"role.mage.tips" : "Kids, watch me go full witch"
"role.mage.switched" : "You've lost control!!!"
"role.mage.backToFirst" : "Suppressed the magic, for now..."
"role.mage.weaknessTriggered" : "%PLAYER% was cursed to death by you."
"options.role.mage.requiredKillCount" : "Kills Needed to Switch to Second Personality"
"options.role.mage.weakCooldown" : "Fragility Cooldown"
"options.role.mage.restoreRadius" : "Restore Radius"
"options.role.mage.restoreCooldown" : "Restore Cooldown"
"options.role.mage.weaknessEnableRoundExpiry" : "Enable Round Expiry Clearing"
"options.role.mage.weaknessEnableRoundExpiry.detail" : "When enabled, Fragility is automatically removed after the specified number of rounds."
"options.role.mage.weaknessExpiryRounds" : "Fragility Duration (Rounds)"
"button.label.mage.weak" : "Fragility Curse"
"button.label.mage.restore" : "Restore"
"role.imagination.name" : "Imagination"
"role.imagination.short" : "Img"
"role.imagination.blurb" : "Rich imagination"
"role.imagination.doc" : "Survive to the end and steal others' victory<br>Each round, imagine a role and gain its skills."
"teams.imagination" : "Imagination"
"options.role.imagination.candidateCount" : "Number of Selectable Roles"
"options.role.imagination.roleFilter" : "Imaginable Roles"
"options.role.imagination.detail" : "Imagination can imagine a role each round and gain its role traits<br>Survive to the end to steal the victory.<br><b>This is one of Half Sugar's gifts to you!</b>"
"role.imagination.ability.title" : "<b>Innate Ability [Transcendent Imagination]</b>"
"role.imagination.ability.main" : "At the end of each meeting or at the start of the game, you can choose a role and gain its abilities.<br>After this round ends, you must re-select a role."
"role.imagination.ability.doc" : "<b>Imagine</b><br>Automatically used each round; you can choose a role and gain its role abilities."
"role.imagination.tips" : "<b>· When there are no roles left to choose, Imagination will commit suicide.</b>"
"role.imagination.prefix" : "<color=#808080>Imagined</color> %ROLE%"
"role.imagination.select" : "Choose a role to imagine"
"options.role.imagination.filter" : "Selectable Role Filter"
"role.blitz.name" : "Blitz"
"role.blitz.short" : "%"
"role.blitz.generalBlurb" : "Charge!"
"options.role.blitz.detail" : "At the start of the game or after a meeting ends,<br>your <b>second</b> kill cooldown is immediately reset to <b><color=#FF0000>0 seconds.</color></b> <b>This is one of Half Sugar's gifts to you!</b>"
"role.blitz.doc" : "Each time a meeting ends or at the start of the game, your <b>second</b> kill cooldown is immediately reset to <b><color=#FF0000>0 seconds</color></b>."
"role.imaginationM.name" : "Imagination"
"role.imaginationM.short" : "Img"
"role.imaginationM.generalBlurb" : "Rich imagination"
"role.imaginationM.doc" : "Survive to the end and steal others' victory<br>Each round, imagine a role and gain its skills."
"options.role.imaginationM.candidateCount" : "Number of Imaginable Roles per Round"
"options.role.imaginationM.roleFilter" : "Imaginable Roles"
"options.role.imaginationM.detail" : "Imagination can imagine a role each round and gain its role traits<br>Survive to the end to steal the role.<br><b>This is one of Half Sugar's gifts to you!</b>"
"role.imaginationM.ability.title" : "<b>Innate Ability [Transcendent Imagination]</b>"
"role.imaginationM.ability.main" : "At the end of each meeting or at the start of the game, you can choose a role and gain its abilities.<br>After this round ends, you must re-select a role."
"role.imaginationM.ability.doc" : "<b>Imagine</b><br>Automatically used each round; you can choose a role and gain its role abilities."
"role.imaginationM.tips" : "<b>· When there are no roles left to choose, you will commit suicide.</b>"
"role.imaginationM.prefix" : "Imagined %ROLE%"
"role.imaginationM.select" : "Choose a role to imagine"
