"role.keymaster.short" : ">"
"role.keymaster.doc" : "You can directly open all doors except <b>SKELD</b> and <b>MIRAHQ</b>"
"options.role.keymaster.detail" : "Those with the Keymaster modifier can directly open doors.<br><b>This is one of Half Sugar's gifts to you!</b>"
